id=treble_off
name=Treble flag off (VINTF bypass)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=minghao680
description=Sets ro.treble.enabled=false at post-fs-data so Build.isBuildConsistent() skips the VINTF check. Fallback used because CONFIG_SYSVIPC=y (required by Droidspaces) violates the Android 10 framework compatibility matrix.
